WEBVTT

00:54.237 --> 00:57.717
This is a story only
she and I know about.

00:58.387 --> 01:02.057
The story of the secret of this world.

01:35.097 --> 01:38.397
It was like a pool of light.

01:39.677 --> 01:43.187
She ran out of the hospital.

02:35.807 --> 02:38.077
Praying with all her heart...

02:39.087 --> 02:41.247
she crossed the torii gate.

03:03.177 --> 03:04.457
Fish?

03:17.547 --> 03:23.267
Now I wonder if what I saw
that day was just a dream.

03:25.537 --> 03:27.117
But it wasn't a dream.

03:28.017 --> 03:31.737
On that summer day,
up in the sky...

03:32.777 --> 03:36.257
we changed the shape of the world.

