Excuse me. I'm Morishima,
who called you earlier.

13:01.977 --> 13:04.287
Suga-san, are you in?

13:06.217 --> 13:08.217
Ah, Suga-san?

13:11.667 --> 13:13.377
Sugaaaaa~

13:13.377 --> 13:14.297
~san?

13:23.307 --> 13:24.967
This isn't right.

13:24.967 --> 13:26.337
Hm, morning!

13:27.147 --> 13:28.397
S... sorry, I'm...

13:28.397 --> 13:30.567
Ah, Kei-chan told me about you.

13:30.567 --> 13:31.847
The new assistant.

13:31.847 --> 13:33.387
Huh? No, I haven't yet...

13:33.387 --> 13:35.827
I'm Natsumi.
Nice to meet you.

13:35.827 --> 13:39.547
Finally someone else
will do my routine work...

13:43.927 --> 13:45.727
Hey, boy...

13:45.727 --> 13:46.727
Yes?

13:49.237 --> 13:50.557
You looked at my boobs.

13:50.557 --> 13:51.407
I didn't!

13:54.187 --> 13:55.687
Boy, what's your name?

13:55.687 --> 13:56.867
Morishima Hodaka.

13:56.867 --> 13:59.177
Hodaka-kun...
It's a beautiful name.

13:59.177 --> 14:01.727
Are you employed here, Natsumi-san?

14:01.727 --> 14:03.827
Huh? Wanna know about me and Kei-chan?

14:03.827 --> 14:04.337
Yes...

14:04.337 --> 14:06.097
Haha, funny!

14:07.447 --> 14:09.347
It's like you think.

14:11.777 --> 14:13.347
Really?

14:13.347 --> 14:15.917
I've never seen a mistress before...

14:18.197 --> 14:21.397
Long time no see, boy.
Have you lost weight?

14:23.027 --> 14:26.117
Hey, don't tell me you
went to play pachinko?

14:27.667 --> 14:31.317
So, boy, you are looking for a job, right?

