37:14.457 --> 37:16.957
Toda Boat Club

37:14.457 --> 37:16.957
Yamamoto-san's Wedding

37:14.457 --> 37:16.957
Asakusa
Toro Nagashi

37:14.457 --> 37:17.617
naze ni kimi ni motaseta no ka
for the sunshine inside me?

37:17.017 --> 37:21.157
Hina-san was only able to
clear a small spot for a brief time.

37:17.617 --> 37:20.677
sono wake wo tada shiru sono tame ni
It's not bad to try living

37:20.677 --> 37:25.587
ikite miru no mo waruku wa nai yo ne
only to know the reason

37:21.157 --> 37:24.427
But, the sky would
always answer her prayers.

37:21.467 --> 37:24.267
Mystical phenomenon!?

37:21.467 --> 37:24.267
The sporadic sunshine continues

37:24.427 --> 37:28.077
She was really the "100% Sunshine Girl"!

37:28.077 --> 37:31.307
kimi janai to nai yo
It can't be that it's not you

37:31.307 --> 37:34.377
imi wa hitotsu mo nai yo
I can't bring up one reason why

37:34.377 --> 37:40.787
muki ni natte 'nande yo?' tte kikanaide yo 
So please don't get serious and ask me "Why?"

37:40.787 --> 37:46.957
kiri ga nai ga iu yo kimi ga ii riyuu wo
Endlessly waiting for your answer

37:43.297 --> 37:47.527
It was like the whole
town was dressing up.

37:46.957 --> 37:51.827
nisennijuubanme kara jaa iu yo
I get it for the 2020th time

37:48.077 --> 37:52.537
What a wonderful world I
was born into... I thought.

37:53.367 --> 37:55.047
Smile, please!

37:53.437 --> 37:59.647
kiri ga nai ga iu yo kimi ga ii riyuu wo
Endlessly waiting for your answer

37:55.057 --> 37:57.097
Go! Go! Keep going!

37:57.097 --> 37:59.037
Look, there's more!

37:59.647 --> 38:04.517
ichibanme wa kimi ga atete
And I get a good answer from the get go

38:01.777 --> 38:03.307
Go! Go!

38:03.307 --> 38:04.307
Thank you!

38:04.307 --> 38:05.307
Thank you very much!

38:05.307 --> 38:06.347
Thank you!

38:06.347 --> 38:07.217
Thanks!

38:07.217 --> 38:07.987
Thank you!

38:07.987 --> 38:09.287
Thank you so much!

38:09.577 --> 38:12.717
We've could really
influence people by the weather.

38:13.267 --> 38:18.287
I realized how much the human heart
is connected to the sky.

38:20.697 --> 38:22.027
There's
miso in the pot. - Ho.

38:23.277 --> 38:24.667
I'm off.

38:28.247 --> 38:29.877
To where?

38:32.787 --> 38:35.787
Terror alert

38:35.897 --> 38:37.327
Is it canceled due to the rain?

38:37.327 --> 38:38.657
It's already past noon.

38:38.657 --> 38:39.887
When does it start?

38:39.787 --> 38:40.797
It's raining!!!
Tell us what's going on!

38:39.907 --> 38:42.127
I've changed clothes to come here.

38:41.507 --> 38:43.047
Surely canceled 
for this year

38:42.127 --> 38:43.757
Shall we go home?

38:43.757 --> 38:44.797
Everyone, make
teru teru
bouzu dolls!

38:43.757 --> 38:44.897
I'm tired.

38:46.077 --> 38:50.607
I've read about how amazing the
"100% Sunshine Girl" is on the internet.

38:50.607 --> 38:55.947
But are you sure about that? To rely
on a sunshine girl for such a big event..

38:55.947 --> 39:00.817
It's going to rain all week.
We won't be able to postpone it.

39:00.817 --> 39:05.277
In this situation, we're even
ready to rely on a charm.

39:51.837 --> 39:54.127
The Jingu Gaien fireworks

39:54.127 --> 39:57.557
will start at 7pm as scheduled.

40:34.987 --> 40:36.927
I... love this...

40:38.067 --> 40:40.747
This job, the sunshine girl job.

40:41.377 --> 40:45.257
I was able to
find my role in life...

40:45.947 --> 40:47.617
At least I feel like...

40:47.617 --> 40:50.797
Or maybe... not not
not not not not not!

40:50.797 --> 40:53.667
Maybe not not not not not...

40:53.667 --> 40:55.717
Yes or no?

40:55.717 --> 40:57.777
You're too serious.

40:58.507 --> 41:01.907
So, thank you, Hodaka.

41:07.627 --> 41:10.227
Weather is a mystery.

41:10.567 --> 41:15.557
The way the sky looks
can move you so much.

41:15.557 --> 41:20.377
My heart...
is moved, because of Hina-san.

41:37.747 --> 41:43.417
Yesterday's Jingu Gaien fireworks
were blessed with miraculous sunshine.

