{=0}I wish for
sunshine
on my
mom's
hospital day

47:19.557 --> 47:26.817
{=0}Please let my
grandfather
see the
blue sky

47:20.487 --> 47:27.657
A special girl who can take in people's
wishes and deliver them to the sky.

47:27.657 --> 47:33.657
In ancient times, there used to be
one in every village and every country.

47:33.657 --> 47:36.067
Kei-chan. It sounds like the sunshine girl.

47:36.067 --> 47:39.467
Hey you... Are you sure
you want to listen to my Grandpa?

47:39.467 --> 47:41.367
It all sounds pretty far-fetched.

47:41.367 --> 47:41.957
Ouch...

47:42.467 --> 47:45.867
Really isn't far-fetched!
Thank you for the interesting story.

47:45.867 --> 47:50.467
But, everything comes at a price.

47:51.377 --> 47:56.357
After all, tragic fate awaits the
"Weather Maiden"

47:57.347 --> 48:00.347
Tachibana

47:59.477 --> 48:02.487
One, two, three.

48:02.487 --> 48:04.427
Your turn Sis!

48:05.387 --> 48:07.197
One, two, three.

48:07.197 --> 48:09.797
Thanks for keeping Granny company.

48:09.797 --> 48:11.997
We're actually here because of work.

48:11.997 --> 48:13.807
Join us, Granny.

48:14.787 --> 48:17.937
They're having fun.
How old are you guys?

48:17.937 --> 48:20.327
I'm 16 and
she is...

48:22.117 --> 48:25.117
She said it's
her birthday next week.

48:25.117 --> 48:27.817
Really? You've
gotta buy her a present.

48:29.717 --> 48:31.927
Come. Eat some watermelon.

48:31.927 --> 48:32.887
Yaay!

48:32.887 --> 48:34.217
Thank you.

48:39.247 --> 48:41.257
Hey, wait a second!

48:49.047 --> 48:50.697
Dang.

48:55.347 --> 48:56.947
Jeez... But why?

48:59.037 --> 49:00.427
Wait a minute.

49:15.987 --> 49:20.257
I didn't know she was a minor,
I swear...

49:21.477 --> 49:23.767
It's not about that?

49:23.767 --> 49:26.267
I told you it was different!

49:26.267 --> 49:28.567
You made us run for nothing.

49:28.567 --> 49:30.577
That's you, right?

49:32.157 --> 49:35.777
Can you tell us about this boy?

49:38.887 --> 49:41.927
A high school boy?

49:41.927 --> 49:46.787
Maybe he picked up Shibata's gun,
that he threw away, accidentally.

49:46.787 --> 49:50.287
In that case, he might
have written about it.

49:52.117 --> 49:53.747
On the internet?

49:54.687 --> 49:57.747
Kids write all sorts of stuff
on social networks nowadays.

