50:15.597 --> 50:17.187
Go, Nagi-kun!

50:17.927 --> 50:20.267
You're amazing, Nagi!
You're the best.

50:24.047 --> 50:26.127
A ring, definitely.

50:26.127 --> 50:29.037
Really?
Isn't it too serious?

50:29.037 --> 50:31.347
It's for my Sis's birthday, right?

50:31.347 --> 50:34.547
I've asked another
woman for reference, but...

50:34.547 --> 50:36.277
What I'd like to get?

50:36.277 --> 50:40.127
Hugs and kisses. Money.
A decent boyfriend. And a job.

50:40.807 --> 50:43.117
It wasn't helpful at all.

50:43.557 --> 50:45.457
Bye bye,
Nagi-kun!

50:45.457 --> 50:46.647
See you later,
Nagi-kun!

50:48.307 --> 50:50.867
Hodaka, you're in love
with Sis, aren't you?

50:50.867 --> 50:54.067
What?
It's not like that...

50:54.067 --> 50:56.347
Or maybe it is...

50:56.347 --> 51:00.267
Being ambivalent is
the worst thing for a man.

51:00.267 --> 51:01.577
Really?

51:01.577 --> 51:06.377
It's the basics to be clear before you
start dating, and be ambiguous later.

51:08.277 --> 51:10.367
Can I call you Nagi-senpai?

51:13.647 --> 51:17.497
Sis has been working
all the time since Mom died.

51:17.497 --> 51:22.097
She's been doing it for me,
because I’m still a kid.

51:23.197 --> 51:27.397
So, I want Sis to do
more teenage-like stuff.

51:27.397 --> 51:30.787
I don't know if you're the
right guy though, Hodaka.

51:32.497 --> 51:34.507
Thank you very much.

51:37.497 --> 51:41.817
Uhm, do you think she'll like it?

51:41.817 --> 51:42.787
Huh?

51:44.117 --> 51:47.067
It took you three hours
to choose it...

51:47.067 --> 51:49.517
If it was for me,
I'd be very happy to receive it.

51:50.117 --> 51:51.947
I wish you the best of luck.

51:52.087 --> 51:54.587
JR Shinjuku Station

51:54.587 --> 51:59.087
Tokyo Weather forecast

51:54.587 --> 51:59.087
Longest consecutive rainy days in the recorded history

51:56.737 --> 51:59.457
Tomorrow's sunshine girl
job will be our last.

52:00.387 --> 52:05.957
A man requested good
weather at the park for his daughter.

52:06.887 --> 52:10.787
After that,
I will give the ring to Hina-san.

52:22.187 --> 52:25.337
Papa, do it again!
One more time!

52:25.337 --> 52:27.557
All right!
Are you ready?

52:28.067 --> 52:29.337
Go!

52:32.867 --> 52:36.117
Ouch. This is bad for my back.

52:36.407 --> 52:40.677
Why you, Suga-san?
Did you know this was my job?

52:40.677 --> 52:45.017
You knew and said nothing?
I mean, you have a daughter?

52:45.517 --> 52:46.977
I'm stunned.

52:46.977 --> 52:49.997
Today's forecast
was 100% raining.

52:52.097 --> 52:54.757
My daughter has asthma.

52:54.757 --> 52:56.307
She lives with her Granny,

52:56.307 --> 53:00.227
but on rainy days
she won't let me see her.

53:01.197 --> 53:04.277
Nothing can beat
a gorgeous blue sky.

53:04.277 --> 53:07.117
So Suga-san,
you're Hodaka's boss, right?

53:07.117 --> 53:09.567
Right, I also saved his life.

53:09.567 --> 53:11.777
Why does she address you like a little boy?

53:11.777 --> 53:14.687
Hina-san is two years older than me.

53:14.687 --> 53:18.467
Huh? 16, 17, 18... Same stuff.

53:18.467 --> 53:19.717
-It is!
-It isn't!

53:19.717 --> 53:21.257
There you are!

53:21.257 --> 53:23.417
Hey, everyone!

53:23.717 --> 53:27.167
Huh, but Sensei, aren't
you gonna be in trouble?

53:27.487 --> 53:30.377
Does Natsumi-san
know that you are married?

53:30.377 --> 53:32.667
What's up
with you guys?

53:36.117 --> 53:39.657
Hodaka thought you were my...

53:39.877 --> 53:42.057
Lover!?

53:42.527 --> 53:45.907
You didn't tell me
you were uncle and niece.

53:45.907 --> 53:48.277
Hodaka-kun... That's
a disgusting fantasy.

53:48.277 --> 53:49.947
Hodaka, you are
really a pervert...

53:50.637 --> 53:52.027
Hodaka-kun...

53:56.467 --> 53:57.547
You looked at my boobs
just now!

53:57.547 --> 53:58.657
I didn't!

53:58.907 --> 54:00.717
Ah, Na-cchan!

54:00.857 --> 54:02.717
Moka-chan! Hallo!

54:02.717 --> 54:05.747
Hey, Papa! I made a
flower crown for you!

54:05.747 --> 54:07.207
Huh? Really?

54:07.447 --> 54:08.647
Hodaka, come here!

54:09.037 --> 54:11.217
Ah, my senpai is calling.

54:13.367 --> 54:14.857
Hodaka's funny.

54:14.857 --> 54:16.707
He's such a kid.

54:17.387 --> 54:20.187
Hey, don't
you think they look alike?

54:20.187 --> 54:21.347
Hodaka and Suga-san?

54:21.347 --> 54:22.257
Yeah.

54:22.257 --> 54:26.057
Kei-chan ran away from home and
came to Tokyo when he was a teen.

54:26.057 --> 54:28.967
He met his future wife
and fell in love big time.

54:29.967 --> 54:33.367
But, she died in
an accident a few years ago...

54:33.367 --> 54:35.707
He's still in love with her.

54:37.647 --> 54:41.067
I’ve always wanted to meet you, Hina-chan!

54:41.067 --> 54:44.067
The 100% Sunshine Girl!
You're amazing!

54:44.067 --> 54:47.057
I wish I had a skill
like that on my resume.

54:47.057 --> 54:50.627
I hate looking for a job.
Also I wish I was in high school...

54:50.627 --> 54:54.627
I... just want to
grown-up quickly.

54:56.487 --> 55:01.087
Right. It's good
to see you are fine.

55:01.087 --> 55:03.287
I was actually a bit worried.

55:12.377 --> 55:14.587
Moka, are you tired?

55:14.587 --> 55:16.057
Here, take a breath.

55:16.057 --> 55:18.007
One, two, three...

55:19.937 --> 55:21.767
I'm fine! Let's play!

55:21.767 --> 55:23.177
I don't think so...

55:23.177 --> 55:25.977
I guess we'll leave now.

55:25.977 --> 55:29.307
I want to spend more
time with Nagi-kun!

55:29.307 --> 55:31.507
Why don't we all
go to dinner together?

55:31.507 --> 55:32.517
But...

55:32.517 --> 55:35.997
I'll go eat with Moka-chan.
Is it okay?

55:35.997 --> 55:36.607
Sure!

55:36.607 --> 55:37.677
Yaay!

55:37.677 --> 55:39.497
Hodaka, take Sis home.

55:41.317 --> 55:42.317
Hey!

55:44.337 --> 55:47.917
Hina-chan! Thank you for
today's sunny weather!

55:49.377 --> 55:53.037
Likewise! I'm glad I
could make you happy.

56:07.617 --> 56:08.377
Oh god...

56:09.487 --> 56:10.297
Oh god...

56:10.617 --> 56:12.407
Oh god, oh god...

56:14.367 --> 56:16.477
So, possible this will be...

56:16.477 --> 56:20.877
...the first time I tell
someone that I love her.

56:29.177 --> 56:29.737
Hina-san!

56:29.737 --> 56:30.237
Hodaka.

56:30.237 --> 56:31.087
Ah, sorry.

56:31.087 --> 56:31.977
It's okay.

56:32.407 --> 56:33.277
What is it?

56:33.277 --> 56:35.027
Ah, nothing in particular.

56:35.027 --> 56:36.697
What's it, Hina-san?

56:40.367 --> 56:43.177
Hodaka, you know...

56:46.367 --> 56:47.877
I...

56:58.237 --> 56:59.517
Hina-san?

57:05.057 --> 57:06.537
Hodaka!

57:06.537 --> 57:07.667
Hina-san?

57:36.587 --> 57:38.997
I think I became a sunshine girl...

57:39.767 --> 57:42.977
Maybe... last
year, on that day.

57:51.167 --> 57:55.267
I prayed for good weather
all day long the day before.

57:55.797 --> 57:59.397
I wanted to have one last walk
under the sun with my mom.

58:05.357 --> 58:09.257
It looked like a pool of light.

58:09.257 --> 58:12.697
Praying with all my heart,
I crossed the torii gate.

58:26.367 --> 58:29.357
When I came around, I was
lying on the roof floor.

58:29.787 --> 58:31.617
And the sky was clear.

58:39.877 --> 58:45.987
I think at that time...
I got connected to the sky.

58:51.667 --> 58:54.707
Connected... to the sky?

58:57.487 --> 58:59.127
Hodaka, hide!

59:01.897 --> 59:04.547
Sorry for the late visit,
it's the police.

59:04.547 --> 59:05.677
The police?

59:06.067 --> 59:08.797
Are you sure you've never seen him?

59:08.797 --> 59:13.057
He's been seen many
times around here.

59:14.037 --> 59:17.587
I don't know him.
What has he done?

59:17.587 --> 59:20.247
We want to ask him some questions.

59:20.247 --> 59:25.467
He's a runaway and his parents
filed a missing person's report.

59:26.277 --> 59:31.627
Also, Amano-san, you're living
alone with your little brother, right?

59:31.627 --> 59:32.497
Right...

59:32.497 --> 59:35.347
That's a bit of a problem too.

59:35.757 --> 59:37.767
Without a guardian, you...

59:37.767 --> 59:38.957
But!

59:38.957 --> 59:42.367
We don't bother anyone.

59:45.467 --> 59:46.667
Hina-san...

59:46.777 --> 59:51.717
She'll come back
tomorrow with the social service.

59:51.717 --> 59:55.347
What can I do?
They'll separate us!

59:55.567 --> 59:58.567
Suga-san

01:00:08.557 --> 01:00:10.707
Hodaka!
The police was...

01:00:10.707 --> 01:00:13.707
I know. Go home,
Senpai, I'll come later.

01:00:13.707 --> 01:00:17.227
Temperatures have
fallen sharply after sunset-

01:00:17.227 --> 01:00:18.667
Suga-san?

01:00:18.667 --> 01:00:20.567
Surprised by my new look?

01:00:20.567 --> 01:00:22.247
I'm in disguise.

01:00:23.187 --> 01:00:26.097
The police came to my office.

01:00:26.097 --> 01:00:29.607
They're treating it like
a kidnapping case.

01:00:29.607 --> 01:00:33.237
I denied any involvement
but they suspect me.

01:00:33.617 --> 01:00:36.497
Take it,
it's your severance pay.

01:00:36.497 --> 01:00:40.887
Don't come back to the office.
Or they will arrest me...

01:00:43.577 --> 01:00:49.167
I filed for custody of my daughter...
It's a delicate time, sorry.

01:00:50.707 --> 01:00:53.737
Go back home tomorrow.

01:00:53.737 --> 01:00:56.077
Then everything will go back to normal.

01:00:56.927 --> 01:01:00.737
It'll be best for everyone.

01:01:02.137 --> 01:01:04.387
Hey boy, it's time to grow up.

01:01:13.777 --> 01:01:16.297
We can't stay here anymore.

01:01:16.297 --> 01:01:18.247
But, where are you...

01:01:18.247 --> 01:01:21.007
I don't know, but...

01:01:21.007 --> 01:01:24.087
Anywhere will do.
As long as I'm with you, Sis.

01:01:25.277 --> 01:01:29.657
Hodaka, you'd better go home
before you get caught.

01:01:29.657 --> 01:01:31.947
You've got a place to go back to.

01:01:31.947 --> 01:01:33.437
Don't say that...

01:01:35.517 --> 01:01:37.477
We'll be alright.

01:01:39.357 --> 01:01:41.607
I'm not going back...

01:01:42.537 --> 01:01:43.937
Let's run away together!

01:01:50.277 --> 01:01:54.957
A special heavy rain warning has
just been issues in the Tokyo area.

01:01:52.777 --> 01:01:55.777
Special heavy rain warning for Tokyo

01:01:54.957 --> 01:01:58.457
It could be the heaviest
rainfall in decades.

01:01:58.457 --> 01:02:01.447
Watch out for floods
in lowland areas...

01:02:01.447 --> 01:02:03.537
A sudden typhoon
strength low pressure system-

01:02:04.247 --> 01:02:08.207
River flooding.
Increasing danger.

01:02:08.207 --> 01:02:09.967
Hey, it's overflowing!

01:02:09.967 --> 01:02:12.917
Keep calm and
walk slowly towards the exit.

01:02:12.917 --> 01:02:16.977
Namboku Line Akabane - Iwasbuchi Station,
Shibuya Metro Station...

01:02:13.917 --> 01:02:16.797
Special heavy
rain warning
announcement

01:02:16.977 --> 01:02:19.967
Several flights canceled
at Haneda Airport.

01:02:19.967 --> 01:02:25.237
Over 6 inches of rain in an hour.
Heavy flooding in many areas of Tokyo.

01:02:24.117 --> 01:02:25.057
Are you okay?

01:02:25.057 --> 01:02:29.557
EVACUATION
INFORMATION

01:02:25.057 --> 01:02:29.557
Floods may occur. Make sure to
follow the official instructions.

01:02:25.237 --> 01:02:28.247
Kita Ward, Arakawa Ward, Taito Ward,

01:02:28.247 --> 01:02:29.557
Sumida Ward, Shibuya Ward.

01:02:29.557 --> 01:02:32.117
You may get stranded.

01:02:32.587 --> 01:02:34.287
Isn't it too cold?

01:02:34.067 --> 01:02:39.067
Rainfall extent and intensity

01:02:34.067 --> 01:02:39.067
Lightning strike

01:02:34.067 --> 01:02:39.067
The "abnormal" rain continues in Kanto,
various places are "submerged"

01:02:34.287 --> 01:02:36.517
It's unusually cold for August.

01:02:36.517 --> 01:02:39.067
The temperature in Tokyo
has fallen below 10°C.

01:02:39.067 --> 01:02:45.077
Breaking

01:02:39.067 --> 01:02:45.077
Tokyo area 21:00

01:02:39.067 --> 01:02:45.077
Special heavy rain warning
Be careful with the once in a decade storm.

01:02:39.067 --> 01:02:41.927
Cumulonimbi keep gathering above Tokyo...

01:02:41.927 --> 01:02:44.437
In just and hour, it's
like an entirely different season.

01:02:44.437 --> 01:02:49.497
I repeat. A special heavy rain warning
has been issued in the Tokyo area.

01:02:49.497 --> 01:02:52.377
The low-pressure
system over the Kanto region...

01:02:52.377 --> 01:02:56.087
because of a stream of cold air
of Kanto, very unstable weather...

01:02:56.087 --> 01:02:59.337
More heavy rain in central Japan
even after dawn...

01:02:59.337 --> 01:03:03.477
This abnormal weather
will continue for a few weeks.

01:03:03.477 --> 01:03:07.117
This abnormal weather is
unprecedented and is extremely dangerous.

01:03:14.927 --> 01:03:21.807
Due to transportation delays,
Yamanote Line trains are suspended.

01:03:21.807 --> 01:03:23.277
What's going on?

01:03:23.277 --> 01:03:24.487
Let's get off.

01:03:24.487 --> 01:03:26.297
I'll ask Mom to pick us up.

01:03:26.297 --> 01:03:26.997
It's freezing!

01:03:26.997 --> 01:03:28.457
What should we do?

01:03:28.457 --> 01:03:31.527
Let's look for a place to sleep tonight.

01:03:32.657 --> 01:03:35.867
I'm sorry,
we're fully booked.

01:03:36.357 --> 01:03:37.837
Do you have a reservation?

01:03:37.837 --> 01:03:39.297
We're full.

01:03:39.297 --> 01:03:41.207
Only the 3 of you?

01:03:41.207 --> 01:03:43.327
Do you have your IDs?

01:03:43.327 --> 01:03:45.057
We can't accept unaccompanied minors.

01:03:45.057 --> 01:03:46.657
It's not a matter of money.

01:03:47.307 --> 01:03:48.897
It's no place for kids.

01:03:50.477 --> 01:03:54.597
You guys...
aren't you runaways?

01:04:02.897 --> 01:04:05.347
Sis, Hodaka.
Look!

01:04:06.017 --> 01:04:07.247
Snow?

01:04:47.947 --> 01:04:54.457
Midsummer Snow

01:05:01.587 --> 01:05:03.187
Hina-san...

01:05:03.597 --> 01:05:06.207
is connected with the sky...?

01:05:18.677 --> 01:05:20.627
Grr, I'm freezing!

01:05:22.267 --> 01:05:24.617
Hey Kei-chan,
how is it snowing in August...

01:05:25.267 --> 01:05:28.137
Ah, the world has
finally went crazy.

01:05:29.127 --> 01:05:30.007
Oh?

01:05:30.547 --> 01:05:33.887
It's unbelievable,
but it's snowing here in Tokyo.

01:05:33.887 --> 01:05:36.657
Kei-chan, wake up.
You'll catch a cold.

01:05:37.627 --> 01:05:38.867
Asuka...

01:05:41.727 --> 01:05:44.867
Asuka-san! You too,
Kei-chan! Smile!

01:05:50.567 --> 01:05:51.927
Brrrrrrr...

01:05:51.927 --> 01:05:55.437
You look like
an old man, Kei-chan.

01:05:55.437 --> 01:05:57.757
You know, once you grow old

01:05:59.247 --> 01:06:02.967
you can't switch
your priorities anymore.

01:06:04.127 --> 01:06:06.667
What are you saying?
Where's Hodaka?

01:06:07.147 --> 01:06:09.867
You kicked him out!?
I can't believe it!

01:06:09.867 --> 01:06:15.107
I told you, the police showed up.
I have to to protect myself.

01:06:15.107 --> 01:06:19.307
So, you smoked a pack of cigarettes
and got drunk because you felt guilty?

01:06:19.567 --> 01:06:21.977
That's so lame, meow~

01:06:22.207 --> 01:06:23.937
See, even
Ame is saying it.

01:06:24.357 --> 01:06:29.317
Really lame. So last century.
Can you stay away? You smell old.

01:06:29.317 --> 01:06:33.397
Huuh, you're lame too...
So... Hina-chan, right?

01:06:33.397 --> 01:06:36.577
If the story about the
Weather Maiden being true...

01:06:36.577 --> 01:06:39.667
If a sacrifice victim is real...
Then, one day she will...

01:06:39.667 --> 01:06:41.227
But that's...

01:06:41.227 --> 01:06:43.547
What should I have done, then?

01:06:43.547 --> 01:06:46.527
Don't get so uptight.
Its just a legend...

01:06:47.737 --> 01:06:50.057
But, if it was really true...

01:06:53.837 --> 01:06:57.767
If you could fix this crazy weather
with only one human sacrifice.

01:06:57.767 --> 01:06:59.507
I'd be okay with it...

01:07:00.477 --> 01:07:02.987
Everyone would be okay with it...

01:07:03.977 --> 01:07:08.577
A heavy rain and heavy snow
warning has been issued.

01:07:08.577 --> 01:07:10.617
Do not go out,
unless it's necessary.

01:07:10.337 --> 01:07:14.347
Heavy rain emergency warning

01:07:11.377 --> 01:07:14.097
Please follow local
government evacuation instructions.

01:07:14.097 --> 01:07:15.517
Hey, you there...

01:07:16.187 --> 01:07:19.057
It's dangerous to walk around unsupervised.

01:07:19.057 --> 01:07:20.887
Are you all siblings?

01:07:20.887 --> 01:07:22.027
Ehm...

01:07:22.027 --> 01:07:23.877
We're going home.

01:07:23.877 --> 01:07:27.287
I'm a university student.
They're my younger brothers.

01:07:27.287 --> 01:07:29.177
So you're their older sister.

01:07:29.177 --> 01:07:31.347
Can you show me your Student ID?

01:07:31.347 --> 01:07:33.047
I don't have it on me.

01:07:33.307 --> 01:07:34.997
Maybe it's him.

01:07:34.997 --> 01:07:37.927
He may be carrying a gun. Be careful.

01:07:38.857 --> 01:07:43.017
And you? Are you in high school?
That's a big backpack.

01:07:43.017 --> 01:07:45.527
Could you take off your hood?

01:07:46.917 --> 01:07:48.257
Hina-san.

01:07:48.257 --> 01:07:49.507
Run away!

01:07:51.327 --> 01:07:53.117
Hey wait!

01:07:53.117 --> 01:07:54.307
Stop!

01:07:56.207 --> 01:07:57.257
Gotcha!

01:07:57.257 --> 01:07:58.377
Let me go!

01:07:59.477 --> 01:08:00.937
Obstruction of justice!

01:08:04.607 --> 01:08:05.817
Let me go!

01:08:05.817 --> 01:08:06.687
Stop struggling!

01:08:07.937 --> 01:08:09.047
Hodaka!

01:08:10.397 --> 01:08:11.637
Stop!

01:08:14.347 --> 01:08:15.847
Hina-san!?

01:08:16.117 --> 01:08:17.657
Please!~

01:08:33.017 --> 01:08:34.767
It's dangerous!

01:08:39.377 --> 01:08:41.347
Let's go, Hina-san!

01:08:41.347 --> 01:08:43.117
Jeez.
Let's go take a look.

01:08:44.287 --> 01:08:45.317
Senpai...

01:08:54.227 --> 01:08:56.267
It's 28.000 yen a night.

01:08:57.477 --> 01:08:59.507
28.000 yen. Can you pay?

01:08:59.507 --> 01:09:00.937
Huh? Yes, I'll pay.

01:09:00.937 --> 01:09:03.917
When accompanied
but wishing to leave alone,
please make sure to
call the reception first.

01:09:11.567 --> 01:09:14.987
Seems like I'm a wanted
man now...

01:09:14.987 --> 01:09:16.627
That's so cool!

01:09:20.937 --> 01:09:22.757
I was really worried...

01:09:22.757 --> 01:09:24.487
Hodaka, you
almost got arrested!

01:09:24.487 --> 01:09:25.467
I totally panicked.

01:09:25.467 --> 01:09:26.377
So hilarious!

01:09:26.377 --> 01:09:28.187
There's nothing
to laugh about.

01:09:28.187 --> 01:09:32.097
The room is spacious!
The bed is huge! The bath is huge!

01:09:35.387 --> 01:09:39.097
Sis, Hodaka!
Let's take a bath together!

01:09:39.227 --> 01:09:40.757
Do it alone.

01:09:40.757 --> 01:09:44.967
Hodaka, let's take a
boys-only bath together.

01:09:47.787 --> 01:09:50.117
It's so warm...

01:09:50.117 --> 01:09:51.987
What's this?

01:09:54.297 --> 01:09:56.937
Wow!
Amazing!

01:09:57.467 --> 01:09:59.067
Switch!

01:09:59.217 --> 01:10:01.727
Sauce yakisoba

01:09:59.217 --> 01:10:01.727
Cup ramen

01:09:59.337 --> 01:10:01.727
Takoyaki

01:09:59.337 --> 01:10:01.727
Fried chicken

01:09:59.867 --> 01:10:01.867
There's a lot of stuff.

01:10:01.867 --> 01:10:03.107
What do you want?

01:10:03.107 --> 01:10:04.807
Let's try them all, Senpai.

01:10:04.807 --> 01:10:05.857
Are you sure?

01:10:05.857 --> 01:10:07.197
I got severance pay.

01:10:07.197 --> 01:10:10.717
Sis, we're having
a gorgeous dinner tonight!

01:10:10.717 --> 01:10:11.987
