01:10:15.537 --> 01:10:16.947
Sorry for keeping you waiting.

01:10:18.287 --> 01:10:20.257
Welcome back.

01:10:30.307 --> 01:10:31.717
Let's eat!

01:10:32.417 --> 01:10:34.487
Let me try some of that Hodaka.

01:10:35.247 --> 01:10:36.827
The curry's yummy.

01:10:36.827 --> 01:10:38.157
Yakisoba's delicious.

01:10:38.157 --> 01:10:39.467
I want some too, Sis!

01:10:39.467 --> 01:10:41.837
Isn't it too early, Hodaka?

01:10:41.837 --> 01:10:43.727
Tastes better if you
wait only two minutes.

01:10:43.907 --> 01:10:46.397
fortune cookie~
Fortune cookie~

01:10:46.397 --> 01:10:49.787
mirai wa sonna waruku nai~
The future maybe isn't that bad~

01:10:49.787 --> 01:10:52.907
mune no naka ni aru mono
Something that I have inside my chest

01:10:52.907 --> 01:10:56.237
itsuka mie naku naru mono
Something that will fade away one day

01:10:55.297 --> 01:11:00.607
Dear God, if you really
exist, I beg you.

01:11:00.607 --> 01:11:04.627
This is more than enough.
We don't need anything more than this.

01:11:04.627 --> 01:11:06.807
We'll manage somehow.

01:11:07.897 --> 01:11:11.857
So please... don't
give us anything more....

01:11:12.717 --> 01:11:15.187
and don't take anything more from us.

01:11:16.647 --> 01:11:18.927
Dear God...
Please, I beg you.

01:11:18.927 --> 01:11:23.847
Together...
Forever... let us be like this...

01:11:26.987 --> 01:11:28.467
Hina-san...

01:11:28.907 --> 01:11:31.337
Happy 18th birthday!

01:11:32.627 --> 01:11:36.337
It's cheap. But I've picked
something that'd look good on you.

01:11:40.127 --> 01:11:41.137
Thank you!

01:11:44.747 --> 01:11:46.517
Tell me...

01:11:46.517 --> 01:11:51.127
Hodaka, would you like this rain to stop?

01:11:52.857 --> 01:11:53.857
Yes.

01:12:01.857 --> 01:12:04.697
I was chosen to
be a human sacrifice.

01:12:04.887 --> 01:12:05.887
What?

01:12:06.377 --> 01:12:09.617
Natsumi-san told me
about the Sunshine Girl's fate.

01:12:10.427 --> 01:12:16.207
She gets sacrificed and disappears,
then the weather goes back to normal.

01:12:17.537 --> 01:12:21.187
Come on. They're
always telling weird stories.

01:12:21.197 --> 01:12:23.887
It's not like
people disappear...

01:12:36.717 --> 01:12:38.077
What are you looking at?

01:12:38.077 --> 01:12:39.837
I'm not looking...

01:12:45.027 --> 01:12:47.627
Hina-san, I'm looking at you.

01:12:48.877 --> 01:12:51.367
Why are you crying?

01:12:54.167 --> 01:12:59.237
The more I pray for sunshine,
the more my body becomes transparent.

01:12:59.237 --> 01:13:01.397
I'm sure that, if I die this way,

01:13:01.917 --> 01:13:05.177
the usual summer will come back.

01:13:05.877 --> 01:13:07.047
Take care of Nagi.

01:13:07.047 --> 01:13:07.657
No!

01:13:08.357 --> 01:13:11.367
No way!
You're not going anywhere!

01:13:11.367 --> 01:13:13.227
We will live together.
The three of us.

01:13:13.227 --> 01:13:14.427
Hodaka...

01:13:14.427 --> 01:13:17.137
Let's make a promise, Hina-san.

01:13:17.977 --> 01:13:20.107
We'll always be together.

01:13:21.897 --> 01:13:24.727
I'll work, I'll earn
enough for all of us.

01:13:24.727 --> 01:13:28.527
You quit the sunshine girl job.
Your body will go back to normal.

01:13:28.527 --> 01:13:29.647
So...

01:13:49.407 --> 01:13:51.157
I saw a dream.

01:13:51.157 --> 01:13:52.937
I was still on the island.

01:14:01.417 --> 01:14:03.137
I wanted to leave,

01:14:03.137 --> 01:14:07.247
I was rushing desperately,
trying to reach the light.

01:14:09.117 --> 01:14:13.947
When I thought I did...
I reached a dead end instead.

01:14:14.827 --> 01:14:19.167
Then I decided,
I wanted to enter that light.

01:14:20.997 --> 01:14:24.727
And at the edge of it,
I found you.

01:14:26.727 --> 01:14:31.977
I had a dream...
The day I met you.

01:14:34.557 --> 01:14:37.057
You looked
like a lost kitten.

01:14:38.537 --> 01:14:42.487
But... you've found a
meaning for my existence.

01:14:43.187 --> 01:14:48.107
I was happy to make people smile,
so I kept working as a sunshine girl.

01:14:49.037 --> 01:14:51.117
I'm really glad I've met you.

01:14:54.007 --> 01:14:57.947
Therefore, don't cry, Hodaka.

01:15:12.737 --> 01:15:14.357
Where am I?

01:15:17.437 --> 01:15:18.847
Hodaka...

01:16:06.917 --> 01:16:08.347
Hina-san?

01:16:08.657 --> 01:16:09.917
Hina-san, where are you?

01:16:10.137 --> 01:16:11.077
Hina-san!

01:16:11.257 --> 01:16:12.127
Hina-san?

01:16:12.557 --> 01:16:14.077
Hodaka, what's wrong?

01:16:14.327 --> 01:16:16.887
I can't find Hina-san anywhere!

01:16:18.327 --> 01:16:23.317
Huh, I just had a dream...
Sis was disappearing in the sky.

01:16:28.957 --> 01:16:30.447
Don't tell me...

01:16:32.007 --> 01:16:32.987
Open the door!

01:16:33.907 --> 01:16:34.757
Open up!

01:16:34.757 --> 01:16:36.087
What?

01:16:38.777 --> 01:16:40.587
Morishima Hodaka-kun, correct?

01:16:40.877 --> 01:16:43.757
You're a missing person.

01:16:43.757 --> 01:16:47.177
And suspected of unlawful
possession of a weapon.

01:16:47.177 --> 01:16:48.577
Come to the police station.

01:16:48.577 --> 01:16:49.577
Let me go!

01:16:49.577 --> 01:16:50.487
It's okay-

01:16:50.487 --> 01:16:51.767
I said let me go!

01:16:51.767 --> 01:16:53.197
Hodaka!

01:16:53.197 --> 01:16:53.877
Senpai!

01:16:53.877 --> 01:16:55.697
Don't struggle.

01:17:09.217 --> 01:17:10.717
Keep going.

01:17:15.047 --> 01:17:19.677
After months of rain, the Kanto
plain is finally seeing some sunshine.

01:17:19.677 --> 01:17:22.627
It seems unreal,
like as if it was a lie.

01:17:23.207 --> 01:17:25.157
In the last few hours,
a sudden change in...

01:17:25.157 --> 01:17:27.927
By 8am, the temperature
was already more than 25°C...

01:17:27.457 --> 01:17:28.457
Miracle!!!!
Sunshine

01:17:27.927 --> 01:17:31.237
Many areas around the
Arakawa river are flooded.

01:17:29.077 --> 01:17:30.167
The town is flooded.
But blue sky

01:17:30.627 --> 01:17:31.587
A dream?
Thank you, Sunshine Girl!!

01:17:31.237 --> 01:17:33.137
The transportation is still suspended...

01:17:32.297 --> 01:17:33.717
I've seen that dream...
#MaybeJustMyImagination

01:17:33.137 --> 01:17:35.747
The total damage is still unknown...

01:17:35.747 --> 01:17:38.827
It will take at least
a few days to recover...

01:17:38.827 --> 01:17:42.467
Everyone looks happy
under the clear blue sky.

01:17:42.467 --> 01:17:43.747
Look at the sky!

01:17:43.747 --> 01:17:44.437
Is this real?

01:17:44.437 --> 01:17:46.427
It's sunny! It cleared up!

01:17:46.617 --> 01:17:48.357
The sky is so clear!

01:17:48.657 --> 01:17:50.197
I feel like crying.

01:17:50.197 --> 01:17:53.357
Finally, the real summer has arrived.

01:18:03.697 --> 01:18:05.017
What are you doing?

01:18:08.667 --> 01:18:09.837
Hina-san...

01:18:10.947 --> 01:18:12.527
sacrificed herself?

01:18:13.177 --> 01:18:15.047
Hina-san! It can't be real!

01:18:15.047 --> 01:18:15.267
Hey!

01:18:15.267 --> 01:18:16.007
Hina-san...

01:18:16.007 --> 01:18:17.237
Hina-san!!

01:18:21.567 --> 01:18:24.117
There's one more
thing I would like to check.

01:18:24.467 --> 01:18:30.417
She, who was with you and disappeared,
was the 15 years old Amano Hina?

01:18:31.407 --> 01:18:33.437
Do you know where she is?

01:18:34.397 --> 01:18:37.127
Hina-san's, 15?

01:18:37.717 --> 01:18:39.747
And not 18?

01:18:39.747 --> 01:18:45.327
She faked her resume for her job.
I guess she had to make a living.

01:18:45.327 --> 01:18:50.107
But she's still in middle school.
Compulsory education age.

01:18:50.107 --> 01:18:51.477
Didn't you know?

01:18:52.517 --> 01:18:54.997
What the heck?

01:18:54.997 --> 01:18:58.567
I'm... the oldest one.

01:18:58.567 --> 01:19:00.567
What a pain...

01:19:01.247 --> 01:19:04.657
Don't you know
where she may be?

01:19:05.427 --> 01:19:10.987
The sky has cleared because
she offered herself in exchange!

01:19:10.987 --> 01:19:15.387
And nobody knows that...
I can't take it....

01:19:15.387 --> 01:19:17.007
This is a pain.

01:19:17.007 --> 01:19:19.097
Will we need an expert medical witness?

01:19:23.487 --> 01:19:24.867
The weather is clear.

01:19:38.797 --> 01:19:41.197
Papa!
Did you look outside?

01:19:41.197 --> 01:19:42.567
Yeah, I did.

01:19:42.567 --> 01:19:45.397
I dreamt of Hina-chan.

01:19:45.397 --> 01:19:48.947
I'm sure it was Hina-chan
who brought the sunshine again.

01:19:52.347 --> 01:19:53.517
Yeah.

01:19:54.297 --> 01:19:56.347
Maybe you're right.

01:19:59.567 --> 01:20:03.907
Excuse me...
Detective, I've got a favor to ask you.

01:20:04.707 --> 01:20:05.967
What?

01:20:05.967 --> 01:20:11.067
Let me go look for Hina-san!
It's my turn to help her now.

01:20:11.067 --> 01:20:12.817
I'll come back as soon as I find her.

01:20:12.817 --> 01:20:16.807
I'll listen to you
in here. Come on.

01:20:18.527 --> 01:20:21.357
Tell Yasui-san we'll
interrogate him now.

01:20:21.357 --> 01:20:22.197
Yes, sir.

01:20:23.727 --> 01:20:25.527
Hey! Wait!

01:20:27.947 --> 01:20:29.697
Wait!

01:20:30.087 --> 01:20:32.517
Someone stop him!

01:20:32.517 --> 01:20:33.917
Stop!

01:20:36.567 --> 01:20:37.267
That brat!

01:20:37.267 --> 01:20:39.367
Don't let him get out of here.

01:20:39.917 --> 01:20:40.927
Stop!

01:20:41.837 --> 01:20:43.147
Wait!

01:20:43.147 --> 01:20:44.507
Stop!

01:20:49.177 --> 01:20:50.597
Bastard!

01:20:53.327 --> 01:20:54.367
Are you stupid?

01:20:55.467 --> 01:20:57.067
Cheeky bastard.

01:20:57.067 --> 01:20:57.707
Cross the street!

01:20:57.707 --> 01:20:58.437
Yes!

01:21:05.787 --> 01:21:06.867
Damn it!

01:21:15.607 --> 01:21:17.087
Hodaka-kun!

01:21:19.747 --> 01:21:20.687
Natsumi-san!?

01:21:20.687 --> 01:21:22.567
What are you doing?

01:21:22.567 --> 01:21:24.827
I'm going where Hina-san is...

01:21:27.407 --> 01:21:28.667
Get on!

01:21:34.527 --> 01:21:36.147
That brat!

01:21:37.147 --> 01:21:39.257
Nagi-kun called.

01:21:39.267 --> 01:21:42.457
He said Hina-chan has
disappeared and you got arrested.

01:21:42.467 --> 01:21:43.637
And Senpai?

01:21:43.637 --> 01:21:46.037
At the Child Consultation Center.

01:21:50.497 --> 01:21:54.897
It's fun! We're outlaws now.

01:21:55.427 --> 01:21:57.827
So, where are we going?

01:22:02.627 --> 01:22:04.787
What? Another visit?

01:22:04.647 --> 01:22:07.397
Visitor's name

01:22:04.647 --> 01:22:07.397
Hanazawa Ayane

01:22:07.557 --> 01:22:09.087
Oh, another girl.

01:22:09.087 --> 01:22:11.737
He's popular.

01:22:12.537 --> 01:22:14.287
Interview room

01:22:13.597 --> 01:22:14.597
Nagi-kun!

01:22:14.727 --> 01:22:17.387
Ayane! You're here too.

01:22:17.387 --> 01:22:18.747
Kana, this is Ayane-san.

01:22:18.747 --> 01:22:19.767
Please to meet you!

01:22:19.767 --> 01:22:21.067
Ayane, this is Kana-chan!

01:22:21.067 --> 01:22:21.867
Nice to meet you!

01:22:21.867 --> 01:22:23.727
And she's Officer Sasaki-san.

01:22:23.727 --> 01:22:25.927
She'll be here with me all day.

01:22:25.927 --> 01:22:28.667
You're like a VIP, Nagi!

01:22:28.667 --> 01:22:30.117
Pleased to meet you.

01:22:29.797 --> 01:22:33.057
Amano Nagi

01:22:29.797 --> 01:22:33.057
Shinjuku-ku

01:22:29.797 --> 01:22:33.057
Food

01:22:29.797 --> 01:22:33.057
Interview

01:22:29.797 --> 01:22:33.057
Interview request


01:22:29.797 --> 01:22:33.057
Interview request


01:22:29.797 --> 01:22:33.057
Center admission

01:22:29.797 --> 01:22:33.057
Lunch A

01:22:29.797 --> 01:22:33.057
(separate)

01:22:29.797 --> 01:22:33.057
A girl

01:22:29.797 --> 01:22:33.057
Second girl

01:22:31.357 --> 01:22:33.137
Thank you so much for coming.

01:22:33.137 --> 01:22:35.327
Sorry for the sudden news.

01:22:35.327 --> 01:22:39.377
Really! When I heard they took you
in custody, my heart almost stopped.

01:22:39.377 --> 01:22:41.717
Same for me!
My heart's still pounding.

01:22:41.717 --> 01:22:44.167
Feel it, Nagi-kun.

01:22:45.627 --> 01:22:47.077
Oh, you're right.

01:22:51.377 --> 01:22:52.987
Excuse me.

01:22:52.987 --> 01:22:53.497
Yes?

01:22:53.497 --> 01:22:57.107
It's my first visit and I'm
a bit nervous.

01:22:57.107 --> 01:22:58.297
Huh?

01:22:58.297 --> 01:23:00.437
Uhm... the toilet...

01:23:00.437 --> 01:23:02.117
Ah, okay, okay, okay.

01:23:05.077 --> 01:23:06.607
Thanks, I owe you one.

01:23:06.607 --> 01:23:11.997
Jeez. You even call your
ex when you need something.

01:23:12.477 --> 01:23:15.927
Here. Look the other
way. I'll take my clothes off.

01:23:12.927 --> 01:23:15.927
Interview room

01:23:26.487 --> 01:23:28.207
Suga Keisuke-san.

01:23:28.407 --> 01:23:29.757
Thanks for yesterday.

01:23:29.757 --> 01:23:31.487
You again?

01:23:31.487 --> 01:23:34.967
Summer's finally back
the way it should be, huh?

01:23:35.887 --> 01:23:39.007
I told you I know
nothing about that runaway boy.

01:23:39.007 --> 01:23:41.187
Can we check out your office for a minute?

01:23:41.187 --> 01:23:42.767
Hey, wait a minute!

01:23:42.767 --> 01:23:43.677
What's that for?

01:23:43.677 --> 01:23:44.537
It's flooded.

01:23:44.537 --> 01:23:46.437
There's no one in there.

01:23:47.757 --> 01:23:51.377
Well, it's a little bit
embarrassing, but...

01:23:51.377 --> 01:23:55.087
Huh? He ran away?
From the police station?

01:23:56.307 --> 01:23:57.977
An abandoned building in Yoyogi?

01:23:57.977 --> 01:23:59.897
That's where Hina-san
became a sunshine girl.

01:23:59.897 --> 01:24:01.117
Bend down!

01:24:02.547 --> 01:24:07.677
Hina-san said she got connected
to the sky on the roof of that building.

01:24:07.677 --> 01:24:10.377
So, if I go there, I'm sure...

01:24:15.227 --> 01:24:16.397
Oh, no!

01:24:19.797 --> 01:24:22.127
You, on that bike!
Stop now!

01:24:22.817 --> 01:24:24.137
Hold tight!

01:24:31.577 --> 01:24:32.707
Wait!

01:24:33.707 --> 01:24:34.487
Natsumi-san!

01:24:34.487 --> 01:24:38.387
Am I awesome or what?
I think I was born for this.

01:24:38.587 --> 01:24:39.937
Maybe...

01:24:39.937 --> 01:24:43.547
...I should become a speed cop!

01:24:43.547 --> 01:24:46.787
They won't hire you now.

01:24:49.537 --> 01:24:53.367
As for the reason of his escape...

01:24:53.367 --> 01:24:57.797
I think he may be searching for the
girl who was with him.

01:24:57.797 --> 01:25:01.037
Kei-papa, snack for you!

01:24:57.797 --> 01:25:01.037
radish

01:24:57.797 --> 01:25:01.037
cucumber

01:24:57.797 --> 01:25:01.037
3 asparagus

01:24:57.797 --> 01:25:01.037
Dear Papa!
I'm going shopping.
You can eat the
cake in the fridge.

01:24:57.797 --> 01:25:01.037
Good luck in work,
Asuka

01:24:59.267 --> 01:25:01.427
It's a strange story.

01:25:01.737 --> 01:25:06.517
He said she's disappeared in
exchange for this good weather.

01:25:07.687 --> 01:25:10.007
What? Don't tell me the police...

01:25:10.007 --> 01:25:12.317
No, we don't believe it.

01:25:12.737 --> 01:25:16.567
But, he's throwing his life away.

01:25:17.987 --> 01:25:22.707
And all because there's a girl
he wants to meet so badly.

01:25:22.687 --> 01:25:24.707
Moka 1 year!

01:25:22.687 --> 01:25:24.707
Moka 2 years

01:25:23.097 --> 01:25:25.967
Makes me feel a bit envious.

01:25:27.077 --> 01:25:30.367
There's not much point in telling me that.

01:25:34.137 --> 01:25:36.427
Suga-san, you...

01:25:36.427 --> 01:25:37.627
Huh?

01:25:38.917 --> 01:25:40.347
Are you okay?

01:25:40.347 --> 01:25:41.677
Why?

01:25:42.227 --> 01:25:44.977
Well, you are, now...

01:25:45.437 --> 01:25:47.007
...crying.

01:25:56.007 --> 01:25:57.197
Oh, no!

01:25:59.407 --> 01:26:00.727
We're jumping in!

01:26:02.297 --> 01:26:02.787
Wa-

01:26:12.327 --> 01:26:13.557
Can't go any further.

01:26:13.557 --> 01:26:15.487
Go, Hodaka-kun!

01:26:19.347 --> 01:26:21.427
Thank you, Natsumi-san!

01:26:26.357 --> 01:26:27.987
Hodaka!

01:26:28.517 --> 01:26:30.567
Ruuun!

01:26:54.097 --> 01:26:55.217
Hina-san...

01:26:55.787 --> 01:26:58.197
Hina-san. Hina-san. Hina-san!

01:26:58.987 --> 01:26:59.987
Hina-san...

01:27:00.797 --> 01:27:04.557
Hina-san, are you there? Hina-san!

01:27:06.167 --> 01:27:07.767
Hey, Hodaka.

01:27:08.397 --> 01:27:10.077
It will clear up now.

01:27:12.777 --> 01:27:14.237
For you. Don't tell anyone.

01:27:14.237 --> 01:27:16.587
That's your only
dinner in like three days, no?

01:27:16.587 --> 01:27:17.177
Does it hurt?

01:27:17.177 --> 01:27:18.847
You're a runaway,
aren't you?

01:27:18.847 --> 01:27:21.577
But, you can't enjoy
Tokyo with this rain.

01:27:21.577 --> 01:27:22.807
Younger than me.

01:27:22.817 --> 01:27:24.867
I will be.. 18, next month.

01:27:23.347 --> 01:27:24.347
Sis' Birthday!

01:27:23.347 --> 01:27:24.347
Bento

01:27:24.867 --> 01:27:26.137
You should treat me with respect.

01:27:26.137 --> 01:27:27.457
Are you hungry, Hodaka?

01:27:27.467 --> 01:27:28.557
Just sit there, don't worry!

01:27:28.557 --> 01:27:30.617
Hey, how's it living in Tokyo?

01:27:30.627 --> 01:27:32.687
Come to think of it,

01:27:32.687 --> 01:27:35.037
I don't feel suffocated anymore.

01:27:35.037 --> 01:27:37.117
Really? Happy to hear that!

01:27:37.117 --> 01:27:42.327
I love this job...
The sunshine girl job.

01:27:42.637 --> 01:27:45.567
So, thank you, Hodaka.

01:27:48.517 --> 01:27:49.447
Wait!

01:27:49.447 --> 01:27:50.797
Someone's on the tracks.

01:27:50.797 --> 01:27:51.597
Who's that?

01:27:51.607 --> 01:27:52.807
Hey, you!

01:27:52.807 --> 01:27:54.357
It's dangerous!

01:27:54.547 --> 01:27:55.947
Hey! What are you doing?

01:27:55.947 --> 01:27:57.907
It's dangerous!
Stop!

01:28:00.497 --> 01:28:02.007
What's that? Hilarious

01:28:02.007 --> 01:28:03.557
What is he doing?

01:28:03.557 --> 01:28:04.557
There's someone running.

01:28:04.557 --> 01:28:05.817
He'll get arrested.

01:28:05.817 --> 01:28:07.577
There are idiots like that.

01:28:22.557 --> 01:28:24.887
I'm sorry. Sorry, sorry.

01:28:24.897 --> 01:28:26.357
I'm sorry, Hina-san!

01:28:26.357 --> 01:28:32.037
I made you do that sunshine girl thing.
You did it all by yourself, Hina-san.

01:28:32.047 --> 01:28:34.267
Tell me Hodaka....

01:28:35.277 --> 01:28:38.037
Would you like this rain to stop?

01:29:06.147 --> 01:29:07.377
Suga-san?

01:29:08.097 --> 01:29:10.417
I was looking for you, Hodaka.

01:29:10.687 --> 01:29:11.467
Why?

01:29:11.467 --> 01:29:14.397
Do you realize what you're doing?

01:29:14.397 --> 01:29:16.697
Hina-san has disappeared.

01:29:16.697 --> 01:29:19.837
It's my fault.
The sunshine girl job was my idea.

01:29:19.847 --> 01:29:20.877
Hodaka, you...

01:29:20.877 --> 01:29:22.807
It's my turn to help her now!

01:29:25.217 --> 01:29:26.437
I must go.

01:29:27.517 --> 01:29:28.777
Wait!

01:29:28.777 --> 01:29:29.357
Where are you...

01:29:29.357 --> 01:29:31.067
I can reach the sky there!

01:29:31.067 --> 01:29:31.897
What?!

01:29:34.397 --> 01:29:35.767
What are you saying?

01:29:35.777 --> 01:29:38.947
She's in the sky!
I'll use the emergency stairs.

01:29:38.947 --> 01:29:39.827
Hodaka!

01:29:39.827 --> 01:29:40.717
I have to help her!

01:29:40.717 --> 01:29:42.577
She can't be up there...

01:29:42.577 --> 01:29:44.447
Get a grip!

01:29:45.827 --> 01:29:47.927
Calm down, Hodaka.

01:29:47.927 --> 01:29:49.997
Go back to the police station.

01:29:49.997 --> 01:29:53.167
They'll understand.
You've done nothing wrong.

01:29:53.667 --> 01:29:57.117
If you keep running
away, it'll be too late.

01:29:57.117 --> 01:29:58.237
You know that.

01:29:58.647 --> 01:30:01.027
Suspect's car found,
going to apprehend him.

01:30:01.347 --> 01:30:05.017
Don't worry, I will
come with you.

01:30:05.017 --> 01:30:07.187
Let's explain everything
together, okay?

01:30:07.187 --> 01:30:08.947
Let me go! Please!

01:30:08.947 --> 01:30:10.287
Calm down!

01:30:10.287 --> 01:30:11.747
Get off me!

01:30:12.107 --> 01:30:14.137
Hodaka, you bastard!

01:30:18.547 --> 01:30:20.037
Don't stand in my way!

01:30:21.707 --> 01:30:23.457
Hodaka. That's...

01:30:23.457 --> 01:30:27.127
Let me go to
where Hina-san is!

01:30:36.387 --> 01:30:39.357
nanimo motazu ni
Born with nothing in my hands

01:30:39.657 --> 01:30:42.857
umareochita boku
I stumble upon this place

01:30:43.157 --> 01:30:46.087
towa no sukima de
Falling through a crack in time

01:30:46.367 --> 01:30:49.067
notauchimawatteru
I was writhing in pain

01:30:49.077 --> 01:30:50.677
Morishima Hodaka!

01:30:49.857 --> 01:30:53.097
akirameta mono to
When those who make it in this hate

01:30:50.677 --> 01:30:51.897
Drop the gun!

01:30:51.917 --> 01:30:55.927
Hey, hey, hey,
wait a minute.

01:30:53.107 --> 01:30:56.037
kashikoi mono dake ga
Are only those who learn how to take

01:30:56.167 --> 01:30:59.117
It's a misunderstanding.
I'll explain.

01:30:56.487 --> 01:30:59.637
shousha no jidai ni
And everyone is giving up

01:30:59.127 --> 01:31:00.897
Right, Hodaka?

01:31:00.127 --> 01:31:03.187
doko de iki wo suu
Where do we all take a breath?

01:31:02.337 --> 01:31:03.847
You...

01:31:04.267 --> 01:31:06.687
Put the gun down, Morishima-kun.

01:31:06.687 --> 01:31:08.417
Please don’t make me shoot.

01:31:16.567 --> 01:31:19.877
shihaisha mo kami mo
Governors and gods alike

01:31:20.197 --> 01:31:23.317
dokoka taningao
Tryna turn the other cheek

01:31:21.047 --> 01:31:22.217
Hodaka

01:31:22.217 --> 01:31:24.887
C'mon Hodaka,
drop that stuff.

01:31:23.547 --> 01:31:26.647
dakedo hontou wa
But even if you look away

01:31:24.887 --> 01:31:28.437
What's wrong with you
guys? He's just a kid!

01:31:27.077 --> 01:31:30.027
wakatteru hazu
The truth is always facing you

01:31:28.437 --> 01:31:29.967
Leave me alone!

01:31:29.967 --> 01:31:31.887
Why are you holding me up?

01:31:30.187 --> 01:31:33.227
sadame to wa tsumari
What if our destiny

01:31:31.887 --> 01:31:36.887
You all know nothing!
You pretend you don't. I just...

01:31:33.437 --> 01:31:36.827
saikoro no deta me
Was just a roll of the dice

01:31:36.887 --> 01:31:38.577
Just one more time...

01:31:37.067 --> 01:31:40.757
hatamata kami no
Or if it's up to the Gods?

01:31:39.117 --> 01:31:40.427
I want to see her!

01:31:40.757 --> 01:31:43.687
itsumo no kimagure
And if they feel like playing nice

01:31:43.937 --> 01:31:47.007
yuuki ya kibou ya
Courage and the strength of hope

01:31:46.597 --> 01:31:47.627
Got him!

01:31:47.347 --> 01:31:50.377
kizuna to ka no mahou
The magical bond we share

01:31:50.227 --> 01:31:51.637
Let go of me!

01:31:50.667 --> 01:31:53.517
tsukaimichi mo naku
We grow up only to forget

01:31:52.217 --> 01:31:54.997
Take your hands off Hodaka...

01:31:53.617 --> 01:31:57.057
otona wa me wo somukeru
How we ever use them here?

01:31:54.997 --> 01:31:56.177
Assholes!

01:31:57.337 --> 01:32:00.467
sore demo ano hi no
But same as you were on that day

01:31:57.847 --> 01:31:59.427
You bastard!

01:32:00.487 --> 01:32:02.647
Go! Hodaka!!

01:32:00.557 --> 01:32:03.857
kimi ga ima mo mada
I see you still standing there

01:32:04.267 --> 01:32:07.357
boku no zen seigi no
Glowing in your innocence

01:32:05.257 --> 01:32:06.487
Stop!

01:32:07.247 --> 01:32:08.277
Hodaka!

01:32:07.497 --> 01:32:10.317
domannaka ni iru
You were always standing there

01:32:09.817 --> 01:32:10.907
Nagi!

01:32:10.717 --> 01:32:13.987
sekai ga senaka wo
When the world turns its back on you

01:32:12.157 --> 01:32:13.067
Hey...

01:32:13.067 --> 01:32:15.857
It's all your fault, Hodaka.

01:32:14.227 --> 01:32:17.327
muketemo mada nao
You find a way to stand and fight

01:32:16.987 --> 01:32:18.847
Bring my sister back!

01:32:17.667 --> 01:32:20.777
tachimukau kimi ga
Ready to face it all

01:32:21.137 --> 01:32:23.917
ima mo koko ni iru
I see you here, shining bright

01:32:24.097 --> 01:32:30.767
ai ni dekiru koto wa mada aru kai
I need to know if there's still anything that love can do?

01:32:30.767 --> 01:32:39.247
boku ni dekiru koto wa mada aru kai
I need to know if there's still anything that I can do?

01:32:40.217 --> 01:32:46.987
kimi ga kureta yuuki dakara
You are the one who found my courage and I knew

01:32:46.987 --> 01:32:52.867
kimi no tame ni tsukaitain da
I wanna pay it back to spend it all on you

01:32:52.867 --> 01:33:00.977
ai ni dekiru koto wa mada aru kai
I need to know if there's still anything that love can do?

01:32:53.487 --> 01:32:54.397
Dear God,

01:32:55.447 --> 01:32:58.197
please, please, please...

01:32:59.177 --> 01:33:00.487
Please!

01:33:30.547 --> 01:33:33.597
Sky fish?

01:33:59.267 --> 01:34:02.437
Hina-san!

01:34:18.917 --> 01:34:20.657
Hinaa~

01:34:21.867 --> 01:34:23.617
Hina-san!

01:34:35.177 --> 01:34:36.757
Hina!

01:34:37.367 --> 01:34:42.807
sora tobu hane to hikikae ni
Instead of wings to fly in the sky

01:34:42.957 --> 01:34:43.767
Hina!

01:34:43.767 --> 01:34:44.887
Hodaka!

01:34:44.007 --> 01:34:49.957
tsunagiau te wo eranda bokura
We chose to hold hands with each other

01:34:50.407 --> 01:34:56.397
sore demo sora ni miserarete
And yet we still want the sky

01:34:51.757 --> 01:34:52.797
Hodaka!

01:34:52.797 --> 01:34:55.017
Hina! Jump!

01:34:57.227 --> 01:35:03.157
yume wo kasaneru no wa tsumi ka?
Is it a sin to keep on dreaming?

01:35:05.437 --> 01:35:11.297
natsu wa aki no senaka wo mite
Summer watches Autumn's back

01:35:06.537 --> 01:35:08.507
Hina, I found you!

01:35:08.507 --> 01:35:10.387
Hodaka! Hodaka!

01:35:10.987 --> 01:35:12.237
Don't let go of my hands.

01:35:12.067 --> 01:35:17.877
sono kao wo omoiukaberu
And thinking about how it would look like

01:35:12.237 --> 01:35:12.877
Okay!

01:35:18.627 --> 01:35:24.287
akogare na no ka, koi na no ka
Is it admiration? Is it love?

01:35:25.207 --> 01:35:31.517
kanawanu to shitteinagara
I know it wouldn't come true anyways

01:35:30.947 --> 01:35:32.207
Hina!

01:35:32.207 --> 01:35:33.837
Hodaka!

01:35:35.257 --> 01:35:40.997
juuryoku ga nemuri ni tsuku sennen ni ichido no kyou
The gravity falls asleep every 1000 years

01:35:40.477 --> 01:35:42.397
Hina, let's go home!

01:35:41.647 --> 01:35:48.447
taiyou no shikaku ni tachi bokura kono hoshi wo deyou
Today, let's hide from the Sun and leave this planet

01:35:42.987 --> 01:35:46.277
But, if I do,
this weather will...

01:35:46.277 --> 01:35:47.407
It's okay!

01:35:48.237 --> 01:35:52.027
That's enough!
Hina, you're not a sunshine girl anymore.

01:35:48.447 --> 01:35:54.257
kare ga me wo samashita toki tsuremodosenai basho e
When it woke up, we were already out of reach

01:35:54.647 --> 01:36:01.347
'see no' de daichi wo kette koko de wa nai hoshi e
Let's head to a different planet for one, two, three...

01:36:03.597 --> 01:36:04.647
ikou
Let's go!

01:36:04.647 --> 01:36:07.967
mou sukoshi de unmei no mukou
Just a little further beyond fate

01:36:04.887 --> 01:36:07.807
Who cares if we
don't see the sunshine again.

01:36:07.967 --> 01:36:10.427
mou sukoshi de bunmei no mukou
Just a little further beyond civilization

01:36:08.297 --> 01:36:11.627
I want you more
than any blue sky.

01:36:10.427 --> 01:36:11.457
ikou
Let's go!

01:36:11.457 --> 01:36:14.527
mou sukoshi de unmei no mukou
Just a little further beyond fate

01:36:13.047 --> 01:36:14.657
The weather...

01:36:14.557 --> 01:36:16.437
mou sukoshi de
Just a little further beyond...

01:36:14.657 --> 01:36:16.567
...can stay crazy!

01:36:17.577 --> 01:36:20.707
yume ni bokura de ho wo hatte
Let's sail filled with our dreams

01:36:20.707 --> 01:36:24.247
kitaru beki hi no tame ni yoru wo koe
Passing through nights until that day comes

01:36:24.247 --> 01:36:27.417
iza kitai dake mantan de
Filled with only our hopes

01:36:27.417 --> 01:36:31.157
ato wa dou ni ka naru sa to kata wo kunda
Knowing we'll get through it, hugging each other.

01:36:31.157 --> 01:36:36.447
kowakunai wake nai demo tomannai
It's not like we aren't scared, but still we won't stop

01:36:36.447 --> 01:36:43.127
pinchi no sakimawari shitatte bokura ja shou ga nai
Even if hard times will come, it can't be helped

01:36:43.127 --> 01:36:49.457
bokura no koi ga iu, koe ga iu
Our love says, A voice says

01:36:49.457 --> 01:36:51.567
'ike' to iu
It says Go!

01:36:56.227 --> 01:36:58.147
Pray for yourself.

01:36:59.367 --> 01:37:00.437
Hina.

01:37:01.807 --> 01:37:02.987
Yeah!

01:37:22.757 --> 01:37:23.947
Hodaka...

01:37:42.157 --> 01:37:45.197
ai no uta mo
All these love songs we hear

01:37:45.527 --> 01:37:48.557
utawaretsukushita
Already, they've been sung to death

01:37:48.907 --> 01:37:52.167
amata no eiga de
All the movies that we've seen

01:37:52.497 --> 01:37:55.497
katarare tsukushita
They said everything they can

01:37:55.887 --> 01:37:58.647
sonna kouya ni
But somehow you and me

01:37:59.377 --> 01:38:02.417
umareochita boku
Fell into this wilderness

01:38:02.677 --> 01:38:08.717
kimi sore demo
But still, I need to know

01:38:09.267 --> 01:38:14.107
The rain started falling again that day,
and never stopped.

01:38:14.107 --> 01:38:17.717
It's slowly sinking
Tokyo into the water.

01:38:18.527 --> 01:38:22.917
And it's still falling now,
three years later.

01:38:59.707 --> 01:39:03.357
What... can I say?

01:39:00.897 --> 01:39:03.897
Congratulations on your graduation

01:39:03.897 --> 01:39:07.897
Graduation
Ceremony

01:39:06.797 --> 01:39:08.117
Morishima-senpai!

01:39:10.297 --> 01:39:13.797
Ehm... You're moving to
Tokyo, aren't you Senpai?

01:39:13.797 --> 01:39:15.617
Huh? Yeah.

01:39:16.237 --> 01:39:19.507
Come on, ask him!
It's now or never.

01:39:19.507 --> 01:39:22.047
So, can it be that this is...

01:39:22.047 --> 01:39:23.887
You know... Senpai!

01:39:23.887 --> 01:39:26.867
There's something I've always
wanted to ask you.

01:39:26.867 --> 01:39:29.897
...the first time someone
tells me they love me?

01:39:29.897 --> 01:39:32.897
Uhm, you in Tokyo...

01:39:32.897 --> 01:39:33.897
Ahh!

01:39:34.317 --> 01:39:38.687
Is it true you are wanted
by the police in Tokyo?

01:39:38.687 --> 01:39:39.877
Huh?

01:39:43.767 --> 01:39:46.607
That summer
three years ago,

01:39:47.527 --> 01:39:51.187
I was arrested and went on trial.

01:39:51.187 --> 01:39:55.657
They put me on
probation until graduation.

01:39:55.657 --> 01:39:58.587
The island, my parent's
house and the school...

01:39:58.587 --> 01:40:02.267
They were the same old places
where I was supposed to live.

01:40:02.267 --> 01:40:06.997
But, every day, I just kept
quietly waiting for graduation.

01:40:08.037 --> 01:40:09.237
I haven't...

01:40:10.677 --> 01:40:13.727
...seen Hina-san since that day.

01:40:15.557 --> 01:40:18.987
I have no idea,
what I will think...

01:40:18.997 --> 01:40:21.197
seeing how Tokyo has changed.

01:40:21.197 --> 01:40:23.767
Nor what I will say to her...

01:40:23.767 --> 01:40:26.797
I still don't know.

01:40:27.937 --> 01:40:33.057
Tomorrow's weather for the Kanto region.
It will rain again all day.

01:40:29.377 --> 01:40:32.387
University Entrance Guide

01:40:33.427 --> 01:40:35.637
Now I need to find a part-time job.

