01:40:59.407 --> 01:41:00.667
Username or E-mail address

01:41:00.667 --> 01:41:03.417
There is 1 request.

01:41:04.737 --> 01:41:09.517
It was a sunshine girl request
from 2 years ago.

01:41:09.847 --> 01:41:12.977
Next stop - Takashimadaira.

01:41:13.607 --> 01:41:17.977
Look who's here. Are you alone?
Where's the sunshine girl?

01:41:15.697 --> 01:41:17.677
Tachibana

01:41:18.797 --> 01:41:21.507
She's no longer a sunshine girl.

01:41:21.507 --> 01:41:24.777
I came just to
tell you about that.

01:41:25.547 --> 01:41:27.157
Don't trouble yourself.

01:41:28.267 --> 01:41:32.877
You moved. You used to live
in an older house downtown.

01:41:32.877 --> 01:41:36.597
The whole area is under water now.

01:41:36.797 --> 01:41:37.967
I'm sorry...

01:41:38.627 --> 01:41:40.567
Why do you apologize?

01:41:40.567 --> 01:41:41.567
No...

01:41:44.877 --> 01:41:50.237
You know, that area used
to be under the sea.

01:41:50.237 --> 01:41:54.447
Until about 200 years ago.

01:41:55.367 --> 01:41:59.097
When Tokyo was
called Edo, it was just a bay.

01:41:59.097 --> 01:42:03.577
Human beings and the
weather changed it, little by little.

01:42:04.547 --> 01:42:10.567
So well... I think it has just
gone back to how it used to be before.

01:42:12.007 --> 01:42:15.837
What the heck...? You've been
thinking about that crap for three years?

01:42:15.837 --> 01:42:17.097
Don't say that...

01:42:17.097 --> 01:42:21.177
You're about to start university,
but you're still acting like a kid.

01:42:21.177 --> 01:42:23.257
But that day, we...

01:42:23.257 --> 01:42:28.337
You two caused all of this?
You changed the shape of this world?

01:42:30.447 --> 01:42:35.037
Bullshit! Don't flatter yourself, dummy.

01:42:36.707 --> 01:42:39.777
Look, I went on a
date with my daughter.

01:42:39.777 --> 01:42:42.587
But, Natsumi and Nagi were in the way.

01:42:42.927 --> 01:42:49.037
Stop brooding over stupid stuff...
And why haven't you seen her yet?

01:42:49.037 --> 01:42:52.697
I was on probation.
I didn't want to cause her trouble.

01:42:52.697 --> 01:42:57.227
She doesn't even have a cellphone.
And I'm so nervous.

01:42:57.227 --> 01:42:59.797
I don't know what to say to her.

01:43:04.747 --> 01:43:08.657
Ah, Ame?
You're so big now.

01:43:08.657 --> 01:43:11.807
Come on, get out of here. Go now.
I've got work to do!

01:43:11.807 --> 01:43:14.357
Just go to her house.

01:43:15.047 --> 01:43:16.647
Thank you for your time.

01:43:16.647 --> 01:43:17.857
Come back again.

01:43:18.277 --> 01:43:19.527
Hey!

01:43:20.677 --> 01:43:23.697
Don't sweat it, young man.

01:43:24.327 --> 01:43:28.937
The world's always
been crazy anyway...

01:43:38.267 --> 01:43:41.917
Next stop: Hamamatsucho.

01:43:42.797 --> 01:43:44.067
You're super positive.

01:43:44.067 --> 01:43:45.047
You think?

01:43:45.047 --> 01:43:46.167
Hanami was fun!

01:43:46.167 --> 01:43:46.927
Yeah!

01:43:57.877 --> 01:44:00.787
It was under the sea.

01:44:02.487 --> 01:44:06.397
The world has
always been crazy.

01:44:08.837 --> 01:44:13.247
So, it's no one's fault
that it's like this.

01:44:13.247 --> 01:44:16.957
Is this what I should say to her?

01:44:27.867 --> 01:44:35.597
sekai ga kimi no chiisana kata ni notteiru no ga 
The world is on your small shoulders

01:44:35.597 --> 01:44:43.487
boku ni dake wa miete nakidashisou de iru to 
But only I can see it and I’m about to cry

01:44:43.487 --> 01:44:50.827
'daijoubu?' tte saa kimi ga kizuite sa kiku kara 
"Are you alright?" You notice it and ask me

01:44:48.467 --> 01:44:51.047
No. No. That's not it.

01:44:50.827 --> 01:44:57.697
'daijoubu da yo' tte boku wa awatete iu kedo 
So, "I’m alright" I reply in haste

01:44:51.047 --> 01:44:56.517
On that day, I... no
We have changed the world!

01:44:56.517 --> 01:44:57.927
I made a choice.

01:44:57.697 --> 01:45:01.817
nande sonna koto wo iun da yo 
Why would you ask that

01:44:57.927 --> 01:45:02.497
I've chosen her. I've chosen this world.
I've chosen to live here.

01:45:01.817 --> 01:45:08.847
kuzuresou na no wa kimi na no ni 
The one who’s about to faint, is you

01:45:02.497 --> 01:45:03.497
Hina-san!

01:45:09.347 --> 01:45:10.607
Hodaka!

01:45:17.657 --> 01:45:20.987
What's wrong Hodaka?
Are you okay?

01:45:23.607 --> 01:45:24.937
Yeah.

01:45:24.937 --> 01:45:27.657
Hina-san, I'm sure...

01:45:28.417 --> 01:45:30.037
...we'll be alright!

01:45:30.037 --> 01:45:37.247
sekai ga kimi no chiisana kata ni notteiru no ga 
The world is on your small shoulders

01:45:37.247 --> 01:45:45.367
boku ni dake wa miete nakidashisou de iru to 
But only I can see it and I’m about to cry

