01:46:44.387 --> 01:46:48.477
kimi wo daijoubu ni shitain janai
I don’t want you to be alright

01:46:48.477 --> 01:46:59.297
kimi ni totte no 'daijoubu' ni naritai 
I want you to be "alright" the way you want

01:47:41.287 --> 01:47:44.597
nanimo motazu ni
Born with nothing in my hands

01:47:44.597 --> 01:47:48.217
umareochita boku
I stumble upon this place

01:47:48.217 --> 01:47:51.357
towa no sukima de
