01:47:54.867 --> 01:47:58.197
akirameta mono to
When those who make it in this hate

01:47:58.197 --> 01:48:01.497
kashikoi mono dake ga
Are only those who learn how to take

01:48:01.497 --> 01:48:05.047
shousha no jidai ni
And everyone is giving up

01:48:05.047 --> 01:48:07.887
doko de iki wo suu
Where do we all take a breath?

01:48:21.947 --> 01:48:25.207
shihaisha mo kami mo
Governors and gods alike

01:48:25.207 --> 01:48:28.707
dokoka taningao
Tryna turn the other cheek

01:48:28.707 --> 01:48:31.927
dakedo hontou wa
But even if you look away

01:48:31.927 --> 01:48:35.487
wakatteru hazu
The truth is always facing you

01:48:35.487 --> 01:48:38.727
yuuki ya kibou ya
Courage and the strength of hope

01:48:38.727 --> 01:48:42.157
kizuna to ka no mahou
The magical bond we share

01:48:42.157 --> 01:48:45.127
tsukaimichi mo naku
We grow up only to forget

01:48:45.127 --> 01:48:48.907
otona wa me wo somukeru
How we ever use them here?

01:48:48.907 --> 01:48:52.287
sore demo ano hi no
But same as you were on that day

01:48:52.287 --> 01:48:55.847
kimi ga ima mo mada
I see you still standing there

01:48:55.847 --> 01:48:58.987
boku no zen seigi no
Glowing in your innocence

01:48:58.987 --> 01:49:02.537
domannaka ni iru
You were always standing there

01:49:02.537 --> 01:49:05.707
sekai ga senaka wo
When the world turns its back on you

01:49:05.717 --> 01:49:09.207
muketemo mada nao
You find a way to stand and fight

01:49:09.207 --> 01:49:12.467
tachimukau kimi ga
Ready to face it all

01:49:12.467 --> 01:49:15.747
ima mo koko ni iru
I see you here, shining bright

01:49:15.747 --> 01:49:22.327
ai ni dekiru koto wa mada aru kai
I need to know if there's still anything that love can do?

01:49:22.327 --> 01:49:30.557
boku ni dekiru koto wa mada aru kai
I need to know if there's still anything that I can do?

01:49:35.227 --> 01:49:42.077
kimi ga kureta yuuki dakara
You are the one who found my courage and I knew

01:49:42.077 --> 01:49:48.727
kimi no tame ni tsukaitain da
I wanna pay it back to spend it all on you

01:49:48.727 --> 01:49:55.507
kimi to wakeatta ai dakara
You gave me love we share, it's all because of you

01:49:55.507 --> 01:50:01.507
kimi to janakya imi ga nain da
You are the reason, let me share this love with you

01:50:01.507 --> 01:50:08.217
ai ni dekiru koto wa mada aru kai
I need to know if there's still anything that love can do?

01:50:08.217 --> 01:50:15.377
boku ni dekiru koto wa mada aru kai
I need to know if there's still anything that I can do?

01:50:15.557 --> 01:50:18.297
nanimo nai bokutachi ni
So insignificant just you and me

01:50:18.307 --> 01:50:21.537
naze yume wo misaseta ka
So why were we given this dream?

01:50:22.667 --> 01:50:25.027
owari aru jinsei ni
And if this life, it's just going to end

01:50:25.027 --> 01:50:28.287
naze kibou wo motaseta ka
Tell me, why are we allowed to feel hope?

01:50:29.307 --> 01:50:31.837
naze kono te wo surinukeru
And if it's just gonna slip out of my hands

01:50:31.837 --> 01:50:35.047
mono bakari ataeta ka
Then why even give it to me?

01:50:35.767 --> 01:50:38.537
sore demo nao shigamitsuku
Cause ain't it sad how we try to hold on

01:50:38.537 --> 01:50:41.647
bokura wa minikui kai
Knowing one day, it'll be gone

01:50:41.647 --> 01:50:45.397
soretomo, kirei kai
Or maybe it's beautiful?

01:50:46.487 --> 01:50:48.137
kotaete yo
Answer me!

01:51:12.987 --> 01:51:15.487
ai no uta mo
All these love songs we hear

01:51:16.067 --> 01:51:19.197
utawaretsukushita
Already, they've been sung to death

01:51:19.727 --> 01:51:22.437
amata no eiga de
All the movies that we've seen

01:51:22.807 --> 01:51:26.017
katarare tsukushita
They said everything they can

01:51:26.447 --> 01:51:29.137
sonna kouya ni
But somehow you and me

01:51:29.577 --> 01:51:32.447
umareochita boku
Fell into this wilderness

01:51:32.887 --> 01:51:37.787
kimi sore demo
But still, I need to know

01:51:39.587 --> 01:51:46.327
ai ni dekiru koto wa mada aru yo
There are still more things that love can do

01:51:46.327 --> 01:51:53.847
boku ni dekiru koto wa mada aru yo
There are still more things that I can do
